First of all, thanks to the 17 people that responded:
(apologies if some addresses are truncated, and if I missed anyone)

  mclaughl@nssdc.gsfc.nasa. 
    mcmahon@cad3.uccb.ns.ca 
     watkins@chop.swmed.edu 
