Problem:

Running OSF v2.0.  <ctrl> O key sequences are not passing through when 
doing a telnet to another unix host.

Solution:

(From DEC software support.)  

Create a .telnetrc file in the home directory of the account from which 
the telnet command is issued.  .telnetrc must contain:  unset flushoutput

It works!

Mary Aplin

