Well, the answers were swift and definitive.  One response was
from the developer of the driver for the DE500, another response
from one who was using the DE500 in two different model 2100's.

The DE500 PCI-based Fast Etherworks 10/100 Megabit/sec card works
fine in an Alpha 2100, but requires: 

Digital UNIX 3.2c
Firmware 4.2
patch OSF350-070

